# BIDS Data Standards

Follow **[BIDS](https://bids.neuroimaging.io/)** for all on-disk layout and naming.

- Hierarchy: `dataset/`, `sub-<label>/`, `ses-<label>/`, modality folders (`anat/`, `func/`, `dwi/`, …).
- Use standard filenames and JSON sidecars; no parallel schemes without a documented mapping.
- Derivatives under `derivatives/<pipeline-name>/` with provenance (tool version, parameters, inputs).
- Validate imports/exports when practical (`pybids`, `bids-validator` in CI or import flows).
- Portal APIs and UI should expose BIDS entities (`sub-*`, `ses-*`, modalities) — not opaque internal IDs only.
